    "body": "Kernel launch overhead can be reduced with cuda graph.\r\n\r\nSync within a kernel is not recommended using triton AFAIK. \r\n\r\nYou can try [Cooperative Groups](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/index.html#programming-model-concept) if that's something you really want to implement.",
